sequenceDiagram
    participant User as Data Scientist
    participant DSPO as DSPO
    participant Init as odh-pipelines-components<br/>(Init Container)
    participant PVC as Shared PVC<br/>/config/managed-pipelines/
    participant KFP as KFP API Server
    participant HF as HuggingFace Hub<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant S3 as S3 / MinIO<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant K8s as Kubernetes API<br/>6443/TCP HTTPS
    participant THub as Training Hub<br/>(ClusterTrainingRuntime)
    participant GPU as GPU Nodes<br/>(Distributed Training)
    participant KServe as KServe<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant MR as Model Registry<br/>8080/TCP HTTP
    participant OGX as OGX API<br/>443/TCP HTTPS
    participant Milvus as Milvus<br/>19530/TCP gRPC

    Note over Init,KFP: Flow 1: Managed Pipeline Registration
    DSPO->>Init: Deploy as init container sidecar
    Init->>Init: Discover metadata.yaml (managed: true)
    Init->>Init: Check RELATED_IMAGE_* env vars
    alt Air-gapped environment
        Init->>Init: Recompile with image overrides
    end
    Init->>Init: KFP Compiler → YAML
    Init->>PVC: Write compiled YAMLs
    KFP->>PVC: Read & register pipelines

    Note over User,MR: Flow 2: Fine-Tuning Pipeline (LoRA/SFT/OSFT)
    User->>KFP: Submit fine-tuning pipeline
    KFP->>HF: dataset_download<br/>Bearer Token (optional)
    HF-->>KFP: Dataset artifacts
    KFP->>S3: dataset_download (S3 source)<br/>AWS IAM credentials
    S3-->>KFP: Dataset artifacts
    KFP->>K8s: train_model → TrainerClient<br/>ServiceAccount Token
    K8s->>THub: Create TrainingJob CR
    THub->>GPU: Distributed training (NCCL)
    GPU-->>THub: Training complete
    THub-->>KFP: Job status
    KFP->>KServe: evaluator → inference<br/>POST /v1/models/:predict
    KServe-->>KFP: Evaluation results
    KFP->>MR: kubeflow_model_registry<br/>Register model + lineage
    MR-->>KFP: Registration confirmed

    Note over User,OGX: Flow 3: AutoRAG Optimization Pipeline
    User->>KFP: Submit AutoRAG pipeline
    KFP->>S3: test_data_loader<br/>AWS IAM credentials
    S3-->>KFP: Test data
    KFP->>S3: documents_discovery<br/>AWS IAM credentials
    S3-->>KFP: Input documents
    KFP->>KFP: text_extraction<br/>Local Docling models (filesystem)
    KFP->>OGX: search_space_preparation<br/>API Key
    OGX-->>KFP: Search space config
    KFP->>OGX: rag_templates_optimization<br/>API Key
    OGX-->>KFP: Optimized RAG config
